# An alias no reached rule names is unreachable.
# error: unreachable_alias.grammar:14:1:
# error: rule 'name' is unreachable: no start symbol reaches it
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
prog! = IDENT                               → (p 1)
name  = IDENT
